(7731591, 1273809, 114285, '<td valign="top">I knew this was yours :)<br/> <br/>Congrats. We were away and staying on the 16th floor in an apartment overlooking the beach, I tried to emulate this but I  had no drone and just my 50mm lens on me, it looked nothing like yours.<br/>Only a drone could do this, maybe we should ban them hehe.</td>', 'I knew this was yours :) Congrats. We were away and staying on the 16th floor in an apartment overlooking the beach, I tried to emulate this but I  had no drone and just my 50mm lens on me, it looked nothing like yours.Only a drone could do this, maybe we should ban them hehe.', '2022-10-26 01:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
