(7731605, 1273809, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow I didnt even notice how high your score was and that alone a personal best. But to tell the truth you have shot way better pictures than this. Im kind of astonished  to tell the truth. No offence to you really. Its what the voters see.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow I didnt even notice how high your score was and that alone a personal best. But to tell the truth you have shot way better pictures than this. Im kind of astonished  to tell the truth. No offence to you really. Its what the voters see. ', '2022-10-26 10:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7731608, 1273809, 83313, '<td valign="top">This was just a drone-friendly challenge. Other challenges may be friendly to someone who has a full frame camera and expensive lenses (Bokeh) or access to exotic subjects. I have a drone as well, and if I''d been traveling to someplace interesting that week, I may have entered a drone shot as well. I also think the drone shots will be harder to score highly with as they become more common.</td>', 'This was just a drone-friendly challenge. Other challenges may be friendly to someone who has a full frame camera and expensive lenses (Bokeh) or access to exotic subjects. I have a drone as well, and if I''d been traveling to someplace interesting that week, I may have entered a drone shot as well. I also think the drone shots will be harder to score highly with as they become more common.', '2022-10-26 11:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
