(7731645, 1273653, 104230, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  I love how the shadows reveal the intricacies of the spars and rigging, plus the added long shadows of the people standing on the pier.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-10-27 00:34:57.</i></td>', 'Congratulations.  I love how the shadows reveal the intricacies of the spars and rigging, plus the added long shadows of the people standing on the pier.', '2022-10-27 01:34:15.000000', '2022-10-27 01:34:57.000000', 0),
(7731652, 1273809, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, Lev.  However, I keep getting hung up on not being able to reconcile the apparently full skirt, as indicated by the white circle around the right hand figure, with the shape showing in the shadow!.</td>', 'Lovely photo, Lev.  However, I keep getting hung up on not being able to reconcile the apparently full skirt, as indicated by the white circle around the right hand figure, with the shape showing in the shadow!.', '2022-10-27 12:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7731695, 1273809, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PenelopeK:</b></div><hr/><i> Lovely photo, Lev.  However, I keep getting hung up on not being able to reconcile the apparently full skirt, as indicated by the white circle around the right hand figure, with the shape showing in the shadow!. </i></td></tr></table> Thanks Penelope! What can I say... you''re right, it does look puzzling. But I didn''t touch anything there for sure, it is basically straight out of my drone''s camera. I wish I could look closely at the original and maybe some other shots I made there, but I''m traveling now without access to my archive</td>', 'Originally posted by PenelopeK: Lovely photo, Lev.  However, I keep getting hung up on not being able to reconcile the apparently full skirt, as indicated by the white circle around the right hand figure, with the shape showing in the shadow!.  Thanks Penelope! What can I say... you''re right, it does look puzzling. But I didn''t touch anything there for sure, it is basically straight out of my drone''s camera. I wish I could look closely at the original and maybe some other shots I made there, but I''m traveling now without access to my archive', '2022-10-28 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
